> Devteam description for C343-172:  "Crash could occur when monster uses potion
> or food to cure stoning or confusion."
> 
> I got this one while playing NetHack 4 (more precisely, one I'd hacked to link
> to win32a -- TL;DR I have a functioning Windows NetHack 4), and the bug turns
> out to be inherited from vanilla NetHack.
> 
> The problem is in src/muse.c, function mon_consume_unstone.  This function calls
